<title>USA: HON Industries Inc Q1 net up.</title>
<headline>HON Industries Inc Q1 net up.</headline>
<dateline>MUSCATINE, Iowa 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.57		    $0.55</p>
<p> Net			 16,918		   16,825</p>
<p> Revs		     282,859		  233,477</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  29,699		   30,345</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q1 net includes $0.02/shr charge on Heat-N-Glo acquisition.</p>
<p>1996 Q1 net includes $0.07/shr gain on sale of Ring King Visibles Inc unit.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
